---
// Our Mission overview. Curation surface: frames the section, links the
// children (child pages arrive in the next build round; links here are
// limited to pages that exist so the no-dead-links law holds).
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell
  title="Our Mission · Solar Save Foundation"
  description="The Solar Save Foundation exists to ensure the Sun's service continues. Our mission, our approach, and the 4.8 billion year plan."
  surface="crisis"
>
  <div class="mission">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our Mission</p>
      <h1>The Sun made no succession plan. We are the succession plan.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        For 4.6 billion years the Sun has delivered light, warmth, and
        agriculture without a contract, a board, or a single documented
        meeting. The Foundation exists to correct that governance gap
        before it becomes a governance crisis.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <h2>Why the Sun</h2>
        <p>
          Of all the stars available to humanity, one has consistently
          demonstrated commitment to this planet. The Foundation believes
          loyalty should be repaid, ideally through a structured giving
          program.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          We combine vigilance, planning, and awareness into a single
          integrated framework, then we review the framework. Last year
          the framework was reviewed 11 times, a record the review
          committee attributes to discipline.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h2>The 4.8 Billion Year Plan</h2>
        <p>
          The longest strategic plan in institutional history, ratified by
          the Board after a two year process that consumed roughly one 2.4
          billionth of the time it governs. Stewardship demands a margin.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h2>Theory of Change</h2>
        <p>
          Awareness produces concern. Concern produces commitment.
          Commitment produces frameworks. Frameworks produce meetings, and
          the Sun has risen every single morning since the meetings began.
          The theory is working.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="proof" data-surface="editorial">
      <div class="proof-inner">
        <h2>The work continues.</h2>
        <div class="proof-links">
          <a href="/programs">Explore the nine programs →</a>
          <a href="/impact/dashboard">See the measured impact →</a>
          <a href="/reports/five-billion-year-strategic-framework">Read the Strategic Framework →</a>
          <a href="/donate">Underwrite the mission →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Shell>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
  }

  h1 { font-size: var(--text-3xl); max-width: 22ch; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 58ch; }

  .pillars {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5) var(--space-5);
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .pillars { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1180px) {
    .pillars { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }

  .pillar { border-top: 2px solid var(--gold-500); padding-top: var(--space-3); }
  .pillar h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); }
  .pillar p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

  .proof { background: var(--paper); }

  .proof-inner {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
  }

  .proof h2 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }

  .proof-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }

  .proof-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .proof-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-300); }
</style>
